  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "財務管理(二)實習",
    "sub_ename": "FINANCIAL MANAGEMENT PRACTICE(2)",
    "describe_ch": "此為財務管理的進階課程，旨在熟悉資本結構管理、股利政策、與選擇權相關之融資策略、財務績效評估、及國際財務管理等重要課題，學期中需作研究報告，以期將財務理論與實務予以融會貫通。",
    "describe_eh": "This is an advanced course in the field of financial management.  It will provide students with the knowledge of capital structure management, dividend policy, option-related financing strategies, evaluation of financial performance, and international financial management.  Research projects will be assigned to students during the semester.  The purpose is to familiarize students with the theories and concepts learned from the class and apply them to the real financial world.",
    "pre_subname": "FINA2030財務管理(一)",
    "pre_sub_id3": "FINA2030",
    "pre_sub_ename": "FINA2030 FINANCIAL MANAGEMENT(1)",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 0.0
  },
